Your chats, commits, voice notes - all training fuel.

4
00:00:06,373 --> 00:00:10,103
The 2025 settlements priced the corpus, not the person.

5
00:00:10,183 --> 00:00:13,635
Now a voice that sounds like you fools your family.

6
00:00:13,715 --> 00:00:16,960
A style clone writes your posts better than you.

7
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:20,354
An agent negotiates in your tone while you sleep.

8
00:00:20,434 --> 00:00:22,017
No uploading. No sci-fi.

9
00:00:22,097 --> 00:00:23,194
Just persistence.

10
00:00:23,274 --> 00:00:27,350
The distribution remembers your jokes after you forget them.

11
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:29,359
Grief tech was the prototype.

12
00:00:29,439 --> 00:00:32,130
Workforce tech is the product. You died.

13
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:35,050
Your n-gram distribution negotiates rent.
